  "question": "If the sign + is interchanged with - and the number 9 is interchanged with 6, then which of the following four equations would be correct?",
  "options": [
    {
      "label": "1",
      "text": "9 + 6 - 4 = 1"
    },
    {
      "label": "2",
      "text": "4 - 9 + 5 = 1"
    },
    {
      "label": "3",
      "text": "6 - 9 + 4 = 1"
    },
