      "label": "4",
      "text": "6 - 9 + 7 = 1"
    }
  ],
  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nAfter the sign + is interchanged with - and the number 9 is interchanged with 6:\n\nOption 1) 9 + 6 - 4 = 1 ⇒ 6 - 9 + 4 = 1\n\n⇒ __**6 + 4**__ - 9 = 1\n\n⇒ **__10__**__** - 9**__ = 1\n\n**⇒ 1 = 1 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) 4 - 9 + 5 = 1 ⇒ 4 - 6 + 5 = 1\n\n⇒ __**4 + 5**__ - 6 = 1\n\n⇒ **__9__**__** **____**- 6**__ = 1\n\n⇒ 3 ≠ 1 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 6 - 9 + 4 = 1 ⇒ 9 + 6 - 4 = 1\n\n⇒ __**9**____** + 6**__ - 4 = 1\n\n⇒ __**15**____** - 4**__ = 1\n\n⇒ 11 ≠ 1 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 6 - 9 + 7 = 1 ⇒ 9 + 6 - 7 = 1\n\n⇒ __**9 + 6**__ - 7 = 1\n\n⇒ __**15 - 7**__ = 1\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 1 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
